{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1339926-experience-points","id":1339926,"title":"Experience Points","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-06T15:03:17-07:00","id":1339926,"title":"Experience Points","content":"So, I'm beginning my first 2e game and one of my players has told me that experience point costs has changed dramatically. I saw the chart, noticed that, for example, Attributes went from 5 to 4, but now the whole multiplication thing is gone as well? What I'm asking is, does it now cost the same to go from Strength 2 to 3 as it does to go from Strength 4 to 5?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25668-geomancer","name":"Geomancer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-06T15:11:11-07:00","id":1339931,"title":"","content":"It now costs the same to go from Strength 2 to 3 as it does to go from Strength 4 to 5.<br /> <br /> Also note the language of &quot;beats&quot; and &quot;experiences.&quot; Beats are the closer equivalent to individual XP in the 1e rules, with 5 beats converting into 1 experience, thus the costs in &quot;experiences&quot; being lower. (Why separate them out? In practice, mostly just for the feel of keeping track of two small numbers instead of one larger, granular number. Or more like one smaller number and then a set of five tick-marks.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-06T15:37:53-07:00","id":1339942,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I know that, I just wanted to make sure. Thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25668,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25668-geomancer","user":"Geomancer","date":". 10-06-2019, 06:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25668-geomancer","name":"Geomancer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-07T03:16:03-07:00","id":1340009,"title":"","content":"It's only natural, since the traits themselves aren't exponential like their XP costs were.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}